# Copy to .env for runs on your own computer. Never commit real values (.env is ignored by git).
# For the scheduled GitHub runs, add the same names under Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions instead.

# --- AI Control Tower (optional; leave both empty to keep it switched off) ---------------------------------
# The Control Tower is the private page that shows how much AI the agents use and what it costs.
# It only receives: which model ran, how many tokens, how long it took, and whether it worked.
# It never receives any text the agents read or write. Empty = nothing is sent, nothing changes.
AIOPS_ENDPOINT=
AIOPS_KEY=
